{"articleNo":"2509","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2509&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2010-1 강의평가 실시 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2010.05.04","hit":"16837","attachments":[{"name":"금오공과대학교강의평가지침[2010]1.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2509&attachNo=1730"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2010학년도 1학기 강의평가 안내</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2010학년도 1학기 강의평가 일정을 아래와 같이 안내하오니 전 학생은 빠짐없이 자신이 수강한 과목에 대하여 강의평가를 실시하여 주시기 바라며,</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">전년도와 달리 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff3333; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">설문내용이 변경</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">되었으니, 유념하시여 성실하게 설문에 응하여 주시기 바랍니다. </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">◇&nbsp; 아&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 래&nbsp; ◇</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">1. 강의평가의 목적</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp; ◈ 수강한 과목에 대한 이해정도와 강의에 대한 의견 수렴</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;◈ 평가 결과를 바탕으로 한 강의의 개선방안 연구등 다음 학기의 교육효율성 향상 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2. 대상 강좌</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp; 2010학년도 1학기에 개설된 모든 강좌</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp; ☞ 평가제외 : 군사학, 현장실습, 교직실습, 팀티칭과목(인원분할),계약학과 교과목</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">3. 평가자</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> : 강좌별 수강학생</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">4. 평가 기간</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2010.05.24(월) 09:00 ~ 2010. 06.06(일) 23:59[2주간]</span><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: 필기, 한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"> ☞위 기간 경과후에는 평가할 수 없습니다.&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: 필기, 한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">5. 평가 형태</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> : 설문내용이 변경되었습니다. [붙임 지침 참조]</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">6. 평가 방법</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; ① 원스톱서비스 접속 후 로그인(ID:학번)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; ② 좌측메뉴 중 [수업]선택 후 하위메뉴인 [강의평가] 선택</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">7. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0066ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">강의평가 미실시 학생은 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">성적열람불가</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"> (</span><span style=\"COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">성적열람기간)</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"> 조치 합니다.</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0066ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0066ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">8.</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">강의평가 내용에 비밀은 절대 보장됨.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;- 담당교수님께서는 수강 학생의 평가참여 여부를 아실 수 없습니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2010 년&nbsp; 05 월&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">붙임 : 『</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">금오공과대학교 강의평가 지침』</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">참조</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">교무연구과장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
